DESCRIPTION:New in your area\nhttps://ma.to/event/edward-simon-femeninas-2
 026-10-23\n\nSFJAZZ Collective pianist and Guggenheim Fellow Edward Simon
  brings Femeninas to Miner Auditorium\, a tribute to the female composers
  who shaped the Latin American songbook. Simon is joined by Mexican vocal
 ist Magos Herrera and a world-class ensemble for lush jazz arrangements o
 f works by Chabuca Granda (Peru)\, Violeta Parra (Chile)\, Consuelo Velá
 zquez (Mexico) and others\, bridging folk traditions\,
